{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "146", "x": 0.8953504215774838, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03839282702615196, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2 Well, it's kind of hard to say. I mean, if you're thinking about your day-to-day", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8268207175865052, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "life, you might find local news more appealing, because it directly affects things", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.8260551637564446, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "like the weather forecast, traffic conditions, or even what's happening in your", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8259686326954333, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "neighborhood. I mean, local news is just more relatable, and you usually feel it", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8259682225956181, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "immediately. But, on the other hand, national news is also important to a lot of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.8261375938193036, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "people because it covers bigger issues, like new policies or economic", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.8260116931760313, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "developments that can influence their job prospects, education, or housing. So", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.8262142824847497, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "yeah, I guess most people would follow both types, but it kind of depends on", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.8264513201779464, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "what's more relevant to their lives at that moment.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.5161514480163113, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3 Well, I think it's quite necessary. If you pay attention to what's happening", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.825924649490251, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "globally, it can really help you expand your perspective. I mean, you get to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.8260987368618117, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "understand how people in different parts of the world live, what challenges", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.8262058754385376, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "they're facing, and how different countries interact with each other. Also, staying", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.8262294561779128, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "informed about international news can help you make better decisions in your own", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5480641079592289, "w": 0.8263168074385545, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "life. For example, if you're planning to travel abroad, invest your money, or even", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.8261627124329859, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "choose your career path, knowing what's going on internationally could definitely", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.8262510889431656, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "help you avoid potential risks and take advantage of new opportunities.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.7272480210889729, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "1.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.020609553398225476, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I'd say it's mainly because they're really interactive and engaging. You", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.766043104771378, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "know, when ordinary people participate and express their opinions, it makes you", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.8259466923553191, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "feel more connected and engaged. I mean, it's like you're part of the conversation", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7462654689772478, "w": 0.8261424124921325, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "yourself. Another reason would be that these programmes tend to reflect real-", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7745958190513854, "w": 0.8217342495783405, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "world perspectives. I mean, instead of just hearing experts or celebrities talking,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8029261691255231, "w": 0.8261204721520182, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "you're listening to everyday people who might share your own experiences or", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8312565191996607, "w": 0.8259463847804577, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "concerns, so the discussions feel more relevant and genuine.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8596116899500704, "w": 0.6210194558529086, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9097460610944726, "w": 0.025044142118860666, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I think if you're someone who really enjoys expressing your own views,", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.9097460610944726, "w": 0.7658251367195891, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "you'll probably want to get on a discussion programme. I mean, when you've got", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9380764111686103, "w": 0.8259900604107785, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}